Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:24:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] 007-add-isolated-v2-header-primitives

Add isolated tagged BLAKE3 header encoding, compact-target checks and independently generated vectors without changing inherited ABC consensus. Keep the vendored BLAKE3 license with the source. Header consensus integration remains future work.

Original review commits: f870586a90229293bd32e0a69464fc946990c851 and a6c7b71648d0764141c0eff8932206e9ebc47955
